{"4891640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Do you remember?", "steam_appid": 4891640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in what seems to be a psychiatric clinic. With no memory of anything, not even your own name, only a list of tasks stuck to the wall remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For 7 months, you will undergo 7 psychological tests. Each test represents a part of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>See, Hear, Process, Speak, Walk, Work, Connect.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <strong>MUST</strong> take that pill every 6 hours. Trust me.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your free time, you can <strong>sleep, take a shower, look at yourself in the mirror, use the toilet, </strong>or <strong>organize your things on the table.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Throughout the tests and the routine, you realize that there is something wrong with this clinic. The tests are becoming increasingly strange and your memories... seem to emerge as if you had forgotten them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to remember… or not. I recommend thinking carefully.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in what seems to be a psychiatric clinic. With no memory of anything, not even your own name, only a list of tasks stuck to the wall remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For 7 months, you will undergo 7 psychological tests. Each test represents a part of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>See, Hear, Process, Speak, Walk, Work, Connect.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <strong>MUST</strong> take that pill every 6 hours. Trust me.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your free time, you can <strong>sleep, take a shower, look at yourself in the mirror, use the toilet, </strong>or <strong>organize your things on the table.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Throughout the tests and the routine, you realize that there is something wrong with this clinic. The tests are becoming increasingly strange and your memories... seem to emerge as if you had forgotten them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to remember… or not. I recommend thinking carefully.</p>", "short_description": "A realistic psychological experience where you undergo psychic tests while living a repetitive routine in a kind of psychiatric clinic.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891640/3223e3be251df17ff5b82bcf59c11d82af2b1e6d/header.jpg?t=1788041137", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891640/143b70245ff0d3473eddbdea8e39e90ef6eb8ac9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788041137", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891640/143b70245ff0d3473eddbdea8e39e90ef6eb8ac9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788041137", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Voider Games"], "publishers": ["Voider Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam A